## Memory TTL Configuration

| Type | TTL | Max Size | Compression |
|------|-----|----------|-------------|
| Session | 4 hours | 100KB | None |
| Project Graph | 30 days | 10MB | Gzip |
| Workspace | 7 days | 5MB | Gzip |
| Persistent | 365 days | 50MB | LZ4 |

**Invalidation triggers:**
- File modified → invalidate related cache
- User logout → clear session
- TTL expired → lazy reload

